s medicine the doctor Boss brought along mixed for me...",0,""],["ctl","avg1_161","a","017","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_161","But the taste... It's not spicy, not bitter. I don't know what herbs she used, but it's weirder than anything Karin and Shia ever brewed.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_161","a","009","shy",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_161","Yet for some reason... I want another sip.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_049"],["say","avg3_999","Heheh. Medicine isn't juice. You can't just drink it however you like.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_161","a","004","attention",null,null,null,null,"jingxia","Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_118","a","002",0.57,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_161","a","013",null,0.45,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["hide","avg1_161",0.5],["w",0.5],["stg",0,-25.0,0.0,1.05,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["se","se_062"],["ctl","avg1_118","a",null,null,0.52,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_118","a","003","love",null,null,null,null,"JuGong2","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg3_999","I've never had a patient get addicted to my medicine before. You keep strange company, Boss.",0,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,-25.0,1.15,"InOutSine",1.0,null,null,null],["w",0.2],["ctl","avg1_118","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"InOutSine",1.0],["w",1.35],["mrt",1,"z","021","sweaty",null],["say","avg3_100","... Really? Look who's talking, Coronis.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","009",null,null],["say","avg3_100","A normal person wouldn't have jumped at this expedition so fast.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_118","a","018","happy",null,null,null,null,"daintou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_118","You dangled the perfect bait. An untouched landmass. Imagine all the undiscovered pathogens and biological samples just waiting for me to study...",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","She's way more into this seamount than I realized...",2,""],["mrt",