 really sweet tangerines back at the port!",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_230","a","002","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutBack",0.35],["w",0.75],["se","se_074"],["ctl","avg3_230","a",null,null,0.47,-0.05,1.15,null,"jushou","OutBack",0.4],["w",0.6],["ctl","avg3_230","a","009","happy",null,null,null,null,"huanxin","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_230","Whoa, so many tangerines!==W== Munch, munch...",0,""],["w",0.75],["se","se_341"],["ctl","avg3_230","a","003",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie","Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["se","se_134"],["stg",0,null,-45.0,1.2,"InOutSine",2.5,null,null,null],["bg","mood_1",0,1.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_bubble_lp",0,0],["ctl","avg3_230","a","009",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["w",2.5],["mrt",1,"y","023","think",null],["say","avg3_100","Nuz said feeding her tangerines cures her shyness... Works like a charm.",2,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bg","deck_alter",0,0.5],["fx",0,"fx_avg_bubble_lp",1,0],["w",0.5],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_230","a",null,null,null,0.0,1.0,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["ctl","avg3_230","a","004","attention",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutQuad",0.5],["w",0.8],["se","se_077"],["ctl","avg3_230","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_230","Um... Boss? I'd like to formally thank you again.",0,""],["ctl","avg3_230","a","012","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"jushou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_230","Not just for the tangerines and bug repellent. You found us a ship doctor, and you only charged four Dorra for the commission... I could never thank you enough!",0,""],["ctl","avg3_230","a","011",null,null,null,null,null,"daintou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_230","A-Anyway, this expedition is only happening because of you.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","013","happy",null],["say","avg3_100","Don't mention it. Everyone in the New Star Guild is a massive fan of the Nova Geography Journal. We're thrilled to help with this special issue.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_230","a","012","shy",null,null,null,null,"JuGong1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_230","Thank you! The second this issue prints, I'll make sure everyone in the guild gets a copy!",0,""],["ctl","avg3_230","a","006","music",null,null,null,null,"jushou2","OutQuad",0.5],["say","avg3_230","We're packing our last three issues into one massive special edition. It's going to be spectacular.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","015","question",null],["say","avg3_100","... Wait. What do you mean by last three?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_230","a","010",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.8],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg3_230","a","016","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["w",1.5],["bgm","m38"],["ctl","avg3_230","a","015","sigh",null,null,null,null,"JuGong2","Linear",0.75],["w",0.75],["say","avg3_230","Actually... the Journal is shutting down after this issue. And the editorial board has no idea when we'll be back.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","025","shock","chijing"],["say","avg3_100","What? Why... Oh, wait. Don't tell me...",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_077"],["ctl","avg3_230","a","016",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong1","OutQuint",1.0],["say","avg3_230","... You guessed it.",0,""],["say","avg3_230","The Trekker Association hasn't had the Dorra to fund the magazine for years.",0,""],["ctl","avg3_230","a","017","sigh",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_230","The editors and members have been paying out of pocket to keep it afloat. But we went from a weekly to a monthly... Now, we're lucky to get an issue out every six months.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","009",null,null],["say","avg3_100","No wonder you barely had the budget to hire a guild for this trip.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_230","a","007",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutBack",0.5],["say","avg3_230","The money is bad, sure. But there's a much bigger reason we're shutting down.",0,""],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.15,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_230","a","014",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["se","se_226"],["say","avg3_230","The Association's geographical exploration has basically ground to a halt.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","025","question",null],["say","avg3_100","Ground to a halt?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_230","a","017",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_230","To explain that, I have to go back to the magazine's roots.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_169"],["trn",0,0,true,false,2.0],["w",3.0],["stg",0,0.0,270.0,1.6,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","4013_B",0,0.0],["cbg",0,-150.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","circle_light",0,0.0],["cbg",0,0.0,0.0,1.2,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,0],["cbg",0,0.0,null,null,"Linear",16.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,0.0,0.0,1.8,"InOutSine",3.0,null,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.5],["say","avg3_230","Back when this continent was mostly uncharted, there were countless exploration expeditions.",9,""],["say","avg3_230","A few of those expedition captains pooled their findings together. That's how the Journal was born.",9,""],["say","avg3_230","They just wanted people to know what the world beneath their feet actually looked like.",9,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","009","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","Wow... I didn't realize the Journal had that kind of legacy.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.0],["bg","4013_B",0,0.0],["cbg",0,0.0,-150.0,0.8,"Linear",0.1,null,null,null],["w",0.1],["cbg",0,0.0,-200.0,0.7,"Linear",24.0,null,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_230","Technically, the first issue predates the Trekker Association itself.",9,""],["say","avg3_230","But it hasn't been a smooth ride. We suspended publication once before, and lost most of those early issues in the process.",9,""],["say","avg3_230","The magazine you read today was painstakingly pieced back together from scraps our predecessors left behind. It took a lot of effort just to resume publication.",9,""],["say","avg3_230","But continents shift, just like living things evolve. The land never stays the same.",9,""],["say","avg3_230","And with our current technology, the farthest we can safely survey is Windhowl Island and its inland sea.",9,""],["say","avg3_230","We've already squeezed every drop of geographical data out of that area.",9,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_169"],["trn",0,1,true,false,2.0],["w",2.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",1,0],["w",1.0],["stg",0,120.0,0.0,1.15,"Linear",0.1,null,null,null],["w",0.1],["bg","view_sea_daylight",0,0.0],["cbg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["stg",0,-120.0,0.0,1.2,"Linear",0.1,null,null,null],["w",0.2],["stg",0,null,null,1.15,"InOutSine",2.0,null,null,"JingTouYaoHuang"],["se","se_369"],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.0],["w",0.1],["trn",1,1,false,false,1.0],["w",2.0],["say","avg3_230","With one exception. \"The Snowcap Isle beyond the open sea.\" It's in the old texts, but no one's ever actually been there.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","022",null,null],["say","avg3_100","The Snowcap Isle beyond the seas... Even the name sounds like an adventure.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["se","se_369_stop"],["bg","deck_alter",0,0.5],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,"stop"],["show","avg3_230","a","007",0.5,-0.05,null,0,null,0.0],["se","se_062"],["ctl","avg3_230","a",null,null,null,0.0,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_230","a","007","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"jushou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_230","Right? But the Trekker Association has never done a field survey there...",0,""],["ctl","avg3_230","a","007",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_230","All we can do is guess based on ancient texts. How are we supposed to show our readers the truth like that?",0,""],["ctl","avg3_230","a","015","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_230","No new discoveries. No funding. The editorial board was backed into a corner. We had to shut down.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","009",null,null],["say","avg3_100","That ... couldn't have been an easy call to make.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_230","a","017",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["se","se_520"],["show","avg1_161","a","008",0.2,0.15,0.5,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_161","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.85,null,"InOutSine",3.0],["stg",0,120.0,0.0,1.1,"InOutSine",2.4,null,null,null],["say","avg3_230","Logically, it makes perfect sense. It just ... hurts to let it go.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_230","a","016",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_230","I guess that's why I pushed so hard for this seamount expedition.",0,""],["ctl","avg3_230","a","014",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_230","I know how bad Leafia's seasickness gets, but I still dragged her along.",0,""],["bgm",""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_161","a",null,"exclamation",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_161","You didn't drag me. I volunteered to the president.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_072"],["ctl","avg1_161","a","006",null,0.3,0.0,1.0,1.0,"huanxin2","OutFlash",1.0],["ctl","avg3_230","a",null,null,0.66,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",1.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg3_230","a","010","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"chijing","OutBack",0.4],["w",1.0],["mrt",1,"z","025","shock",null],["say","avg3_100","Leafia? What are you doing out on deck? Are you okay?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_161","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_161","I'm fine. Doctor Coronis's medicine kicked in, so I came up for some air.",0,""],["w",0.5],["bgm","m31"],["ctl","avg1_161","a","016",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_161","Mikan,==W== I'm actually a little annoyed with you right now.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_161","a","006","resentful",null,null,null,null,"buman","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_230","a","010","question",null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_230","Huh?",0,""],["se","se_074"],["stg",0,-45.0,null,1.07,"OutQuad",0.5,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_161","a",null,null,0.38,null,null,null,"jushou","OutQuad",0.5],["w",0.65],["ctl","avg1_161","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,"jushou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_161","You said you dragged me here, but a seamount just popped up out of nowhere. Did you really think I could just sit still?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_161","a","014",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_161","Nothing beats seeing the continent change with my own eyes. Even the slightest terrain shift drives me crazy until it's updated on the map.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_161","a","008",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_161","Besides, can you even imagine the impact this seamount will have on the Sunken Sea's hydrographic data?",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_062"],["stg",0,-45.0,0.0,1.25,"OutQuad",0.5,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_161","a","006",null,0.4,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["ctl","avg3_230","a","010",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_161","So even if you hadn't petitioned President Horizon, I would've gone. I'd have swum out there to map it myself.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","025","shock",null],["say","avg3_100","... Haha, swimming might be pushing it.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_230","a","014",null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["hide","avg3_230",1.0],["ctl","a